&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Partner with Engineering and Design to define and deliver the product roadmap for Sony Music&#39;s RoyaltyShare platform&lt;br&gt;● Translate complex business, financial, and operational requirements into clear product requirements and user stories&lt;br&gt;● Own and prioritize the product backlog, balancing business value, technical complexity, and platform health&lt;br&gt;● Lead Agile ceremonies and work closely with engineering teams throughout the product development lifecycle&lt;br&gt;● Build strong relationships with stakeholders across Royalty Operations, Finance, Product, and Engineering to understand pain points and identify opportunities for improvement&lt;br&gt;● Gather user feedback and operational insights to continuously refine product direction&lt;br&gt;● Help define success metrics and monitor product performance using quantitative and qualitative KPIs&lt;br&gt;● Participate in product releases, rollout planning, change management, and adoption activities&lt;br&gt;● Clearly communicate priorities, roadmap updates, and product decisions to both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;br&gt;● Support the modernization of legacy royalty systems through incremental product improvements and platform enhancements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 5-7+ years of Product Management experience delivering complex software products, preferably enterprise or internal platforms&lt;br&gt;● Experience managing products from discovery through delivery and ongoing iteration&lt;br&gt;● Strong experience working closely with engineering teams in Agile environments&lt;br&gt;● Excellent prioritization skills with the ability to balance customer needs, technical constraints, and business priorities&lt;br&gt;● Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with experience using data to inform product decisions&lt;br&gt;● Exceptional written and verbal communication skills with the ability to simplify complex technical concepts for business audiences&lt;br&gt;● Experience creating product documentation including user stories, acceptance criteria, process flows, and roadmap documentation&lt;br&gt;● Experience collaborating across multiple stakeholder groups to build alignment and drive execution&lt;br&gt;● Comfortable working with technical teams and understanding system architecture, APIs, and software development concepts&lt;br&gt;● Interest in learning the complexities of music royalty accounting and rights management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ideal candidate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Experience building enterprise SaaS, financial systems, ERP platforms, accounting software, or other workflow-driven applications&lt;br&gt;● Experience working with complex business domains involving financial transactions, payments, or large-scale operational processes&lt;br&gt;● Familiarity with data platforms and modern data technologies such as Snowflake, SQL, or analytics tools&lt;br&gt;● Experience with platform modernization or legacy system transformation initiatives&lt;br&gt;● Experience defining KPIs and measuring operational improvements through product analytics&lt;br&gt;● Strong understanding of workflow optimization, process automation, and operational efficiency&lt;br&gt;● Demonstrated ability to influence cross-functional teams without direct authority&lt;br&gt;● Experience working with global stakeholders across multiple regions and time zones&lt;br&gt;● Interest in music, technology, and building products that directly support artists and creators&lt;/p&gt;
