&lt;li&gt;Act as the voice of the customer to influence product and go-to-market strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retention and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Product, and Marketing to drive adoption and expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support renewal strategies and improve retention outcomes across segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data to contribute to accurate forecasting and pipeline visibility&lt;/li&gt;
