&lt;p&gt;The Role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Lead Data Platform Engineer to provide hands-on technical leadership in designing, building and evolving secure, scalable and reliable data platforms for clients across the public sector and utilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across cloud-native and distributed data platforms, helping engineering teams build reliable platform capabilities that support batch, real-time streaming, analytical and operational workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role combines hands-on engineering with technical leadership. You will contribute to platform architecture and design decisions, establish engineering standards, solve complex technical challenges and work closely with architects, engineers and client stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong experience with cloud platforms, distributed systems and data platform engineering is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
