&lt;p&gt;You are a hands-on platform engineer who understands how to build reliable data infrastructure that works in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You enjoy solving complex problems across cloud, distributed systems, streaming, data platforms and infrastructure, and can translate architectural requirements into practical engineering solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are comfortable moving between hands-on development, technical design and stakeholder discussions, while helping other engineers improve their technical capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You care about reliability, scalability, security, observability and maintainability, not simply getting a platform into production.&lt;/p&gt;
